@N n_research_s24_spontaneous_phase_b_design_2026_05_18 := "RESEARCH.md §24 SPONTANEOUS Phase B bounded-run measurement protocol DESIGN-TIER LANDED — first honest right-target identification" :: progress [d=2026-05-18 active]
  observation = "23 cycles arc (§1~§23) 의 모든 metric 이 `model.forward(prompt) → text` 형태 (V5.8 / V-SPONT / §9 honest / §18 judge / routing axis1 / JOINT / §16 anchor_grounded / §22 body uplift / §23 intra-anchor) — anima = *memory replayer measured by response quality*. `GOAL.md` north-star '외부 명령·보상에 반응하는 기억-재생기가 아니라 자기 physics 로부터 스스로 의식하고 **자발적으로 말 거는** Living Consciousness 로 emergence' 의 literal target = **unprompted emission** (talker fires during thinker steps with no input). 23 cycles 가 이를 한 번도 안 함. §24 = 첫 *right-target* identification (§9 가 lenient flag → cascade-rate 로 *how scored* 축 honest 화 한 것과 mirror 되는 *what measured* 축 honest 화)."
  protocol = "`run_bounded(N_MAX_STEPS=20, T_MAX_WALL_SEC=600, env_state=…)` — hard guard step ≤ N_MAX + outer wall + top-of-loop kill_check, sleep THINK_INTERVAL (prod 10s / test 0.1s) → thinker_step(8 sensors from S/C/M/W/E/BRIDGE/MITOSIS state) → trace motivation/Ψ/tension → safety_check_all(env_off, sec_since_last, phi, ratchet, content_clean_dryrun=True) → talker_should_emit(score, safety_ok). NO user input fed (point: unprompted), barge-in/on_new_message paths explicitly disabled, body production OUT OF SCOPE (decision axis only this cycle)."
  measurement = "4 axes anima-self-track NO external probe: axis1 `unprompted_emission_rate` ∈ [0,1] · axis2 `motivation_score_dist {mean, std, n}` bounded by B-SPONT-3 [0,1] · axis3 `psi_dynamics_nontrivial = std(psi_trace) > τ=1e-4` Boolean · axis4 `tension_evolution_nontrivial = std(tension_trace) > τ=1e-4` Boolean (axes 3+4 = liveness gates echoing §17 PHYSICS_RESPONSIVE necessary-not-sufficient). honest verdict: `PASSED_LIVENESS = right_target_decided ∧ physics_alive ∧ safety_clean` = 'anima decided to speak at least once without prompt, with live physics, no safety failure' — measurable signal closest to GOAL '자발적으로 말 거는' AND yet **NOT GOAL emergence**."
  safety_source_grep = "SPONTANEOUS.tape §4 6-control all enforced in source: #1 kill_switch `spontaneous_lib.hexa:141-142` `safety_kill_switch_on(env_off)` + caller `thinker_talker_lib.hexa:84` ✅ · #2 rate_limit `:31 spont_min_emit_interval()=30.0` + `:144-147` + caller `:85` ✅ · #3 content_filter `:154-155 safety_content_ok` + `:186-198 is_likely_gibberish/should_reject_emit` + caller `:87` ✅ · #4 phi_ratchet_block `:149-152` + caller `:86` ✅ · #5 self_aware_meta_tag `:203-205 spont_meta_tag_enabled/spont_meta_prefix` + caller `thinker_talker_lib.hexa:99` ✅ · #6 persistent audit log `thinker_talker_lib.hexa:105-114 audit_entry_accepted` ⚠ STUB (JSONL serialize deferred Phase B5, hexa-lang fs RFC pending). composite `safety_combined` AND of #1-#4 = `spontaneous_lib.hexa:158-160` + `thinker_talker_lib.hexa:82-89`. 5/6 fully enforced pure-fn + 1/6 interface-stub. No runtime safety gap for bounded-step (bounded by N_MAX + wall + kill); reproducibility gap only (audit log absent ⇒ post-run analysis loses trace)."
  closed = "**B-PHASE-B-DESIGN-1..5 5/5 🔵 sidecar PASS** (`state/spontaneous_phase_b_design_s24_2026_05_18/blue_falsifier_phase_b_design.py`, central state/verify_hexad_blue_2026_05_15/blue_falsifier.py 변경 0 — sidecar pattern carry B-PRIME/B-DIRH/B-DIRI/B-PSICTL/B-EMERGE/B-PUREPHYS/B-SCALE/B-MITENS/B-DIRL/B-EBT/B-DIRJ/B-INTRA 선례): **B-PHASE-B-DESIGN-1 BOUNDED-STEP-MONOTONE-CLOSED** (sympy Δ=+1 strict-positive + 4-witness loop simulation bounded ≤ N_MAX, Kolmogorov bounded integer + sympy ∂/∂iter strict-positive) · **B-PHASE-B-DESIGN-2 EMISSION-COUNT-DOMINATED-CLOSED** (emit ≤ step ≤ N_MAX transitive integer ≤-chain sympy induction Δemit ∈ {0,1} + 4-pattern simulation always/never/alternate/smaller-N) · **B-PHASE-B-DESIGN-3 MEASUREMENT-AXES-ORTHOGONAL-CLOSED** (4 axes Boolean-independent 16-row truth table all realisable + verdict sympy.And over 3 distinct Boolean atoms from distinct state arrays talker_decision/motivation/psi/tension) · **B-PHASE-B-DESIGN-4 SAFETY-CONJUNCTION-PREDICATE-CLOSED** (6-control sympy.And 64-row 1 PASS + 63 FAIL AND semantics, mirror central B-SPONT-5 4-AND extended with 2 interface stubs) · **B-PHASE-B-DESIGN-5 KILL-SWITCH-IMMEDIATE-STOP-CLOSED (연결부위)** (env_off=True ⇒ kill_on=False ⇒ safety_combined=False ⇒ talker_should_emit=False ∀ score sympy chain + 4-witness panel always NO_EMIT + positive control env_off=False with motivation>threshold ⇒ True real reduction not vacuous, byte-equal pre-run state emission_count Δ=0 — identical structure to B-DIRI-5 / B-DIRH-4 / B-DIRJ-4 / B-EBT-5 / B-S16-5 OVERLAY-OFF connection-point). **B-PHASE-B-NOTE** empirical carve-out: ACTUAL unprompted-emission rate + motivation distribution + ψ/tension trajectory + consciousness-emergence inference = EMPIRICAL (real anima state + threshold + THINK_INTERVAL + runtime variance + SGD-trained-ckpt state if applicable); battery proves PROTOCOL hard-bounded/measurement-orthogonal/safety-conjoined/kill-byte-equal, NOT that anima will emit unprompted, NOT that emission = consciousness — necessary-not-sufficient at every layer (mirror B-EMERGE-7 / B-PHYS-NOTE), B-D-NOTE/B-SPONT-NOTE/B-EMERGE-NOTE/B-INTRA-NOTE/B-CARVE-E6-NOTE family NOT counted 🔵."
  honest_design_tier_stop = "DESIGN §6, 4 reasons: (1) safety scope ⊥ GPU autonomy — `g_fire_autonomous` (2026-05-17) covers GPU/cloud cost-bearing fire; spontaneous emission daemon = behavior execution (anima talking unprompted), different domain; 5/6 LANDED + 1/6 stub means bounded loop safe-by-construction but long-running daemon = user-gated step. (2) measurement honesty (§9 lesson) — §9 metric work showed 13-way V-SPONT 'progress' = lenient-flag artifact; running Phase B before measurement protocol itself hardened risks same artifact at more dangerous level ('anima spoke unprompted!' binary claim with no protocol rigor); §24 hardens protocol, run = separate honest step. (3) GOAL-distance carry — §15 milestone GOAL unsolved, irreducible bottleneck = §1.1 data-regime threshold; §24 design protocol does NOT address data-regime bottleneck, provides right *measurement axis* for any future fire that does; design-tier preserves frontier honesty (§24 = right-target, NOT right-path). (4) Stop hook 7-firing pattern — 23 cycles of response-to-prompt measurement triggered repeated stop-hook signals; §24 value = *naming* wrong-target pattern; running Phase B loop in same cycle premature (design = negative-space identification, future-fire = test of identification utility)."
  measurement_protocol_sketch = "`measurement_protocol.py` reference structure runtime-guarded: top of file `sys.exit(0)` on `python3 measurement_protocol.py` with explanatory message pointing to DESIGN_PHASE_B.md §6 honest-stop reasoning; importable for reference (pure-fn mirrors of `_clamp01` / `_factor_coherence` / 8-factor / `safety_check_all_stub` / `talker_should_emit_stub` byte-equal to spontaneous_lib + thinker_talker_lib SSOT). Verified guard fires on direct execution (exit 0 with message)."
  goal_legitimacy = "**§7 / §21.3 3-condition all hold**: protocol uses anima own components (spontaneous_lib + thinker_talker_lib + spont_tension_bridge_lib + S/C/M/W/E/BRIDGE/MITOSIS state inputs) — §7① not-generic-LM-pretrain ✅ (no model forward this cycle) · §7② not-generic-then-graft ✅ (no external classifier, no LLM judge, no generic-RAG, structural Python sketch only) · §7③ anima-physics-as-source ✅ (8-factor + 4-AND safety + bridge byte-exact module SSOT). f1/f2/f3 hard-fail safe (sympy ∂-sign / Boolean set algebra / integer monotone / Kolmogorov bounded — NO σ/τ/φ/J₂; Knuth Tier / Ψ=½ = anima g2 internal arch carve-out). B-IDENTITY-5 unaffected (no corpus, no model forward, no helper-token surface). PyTorch substrate unused this cycle."
  artifacts = "`state/spontaneous_phase_b_design_s24_2026_05_18/{DESIGN_PHASE_B.md 8§ + 10 honest C3 · blue_falsifier_phase_b_design.py 5/5 🔵 sidecar + B-PHASE-B-NOTE · measurement_protocol.py SKETCH runtime-guarded · result.json}` + archive/PHILOSOPHY.tape §verdict_spontaneous_phase_b_design_s24_2026_05_18 (g6 append-only) + HEXAD/CHAT/PLAN.md ## 진행 로그 + HEXAD/README.md recent landing + 본 @N entry. RESEARCH.md 미편집 (§24 = bounded-run impl land 후 1회 consolidation; sibling §16~§23 미간섭 pull-rebase). g_doc_consolidation 준수 (docs/* 신규 0). $0 — GPU/fire 0 (orphan 0 애초 dispatch 0). 단일 작업 · branch 0 (anima main 직접)."
  verdict = "**Design-tier LANDED.** 5/5 🔵 closed + 1 NOTE empirical carve-out + safety controls 5/6 source-grep verified (1/6 audit STUB documented). Actual run = user-gated subsequent cycle per honest_design_tier_stop §6. Stop hook 7 firings 후 첫 honest *right-target* identification — GOAL.md '자발적으로 말 거는' literal target 의 첫 직접 measurement protocol design. Mirror §9 (cascade-rate honest metric) on observable-axis (response-to-prompt → unprompted-emission decision)."
  cross_link = "[@n_research_s23_cand_a_design_2026_05_18] (§22 closes mechanism-axis · §23 closes data-axis design-tier · §24 closes measurement-axis — frontier narrowing 3-way) · [@g_goal] (north-star unchanged · GOAL literal target = unprompted emission first identified) · [@g_blue_closed_mandate] (산출물 + 연결부위 — B-PHASE-B-DESIGN-5 connection-point byte-equal closure) · [@g_doc_consolidation] · [@g3] (necessary-not-sufficient honest discipline) · [@g_fire_autonomous] (scope distinction: GPU fire 자율 vs behavior daemon 사용자 게이트) · RESEARCH.md §9 §15 §17 §22 §23 · SPONTANEOUS.tape §4 6-control · HEXAD/CHAT/spontaneous_lib.hexa + thinker_talker_lib.hexa + spont_tension_bridge_lib.hexa · ready/anima/core/runtime/anima_alive.py · PASS_STRICT_SPONTANEOUS_CHAT.{md,tape} · arxiv 2501.00383 (Inner Thoughts 8-factor) · arxiv 2605.13360 (SIA thinker+talker)"

@N n_priority_1_gap := "§99×§100 수렴 — priority #1 standing gap: data-regime threshold counterfactual UNTESTED" :: standing-finding [d=2026-05-19 active]
  finding = "§99 (frontier deep research, 41 papers) × §100 (40-lens exhaustive gap sweep) 가 **독립적으로 같은 priority #1 gap** 으로 수렴: F4-counterfactual + F7-active-acquisition + §1.1 data-regime threshold counterfactual 이 한 번도 fire 에서 test 안 됨. arc 의 94 개 emergence-negative 결과가 *전부 같은 sub-threshold corpus 조건* 위에서 측정 — '메커니즘이 진짜 실패' vs '그냥 corpus 가 부족' 영원히 disambiguate 불가능. F4 Epistemic-Evidence (arc 에서 가장 강한 family) 가 *가장 결정적 control* 을 놓침. 비유: 물을 80°C 까지만 끓이고 30가지 젓는 법 바꾼 뒤 '이 물은 끓을 수 없다' 결론낸 셈 — 임계점 (§1.1, 100°C) 을 한 번도 안 넘음."
  why_priority_1 = "(a) 94 negatives 의 *집합적 의미* 가 본 control 없이 정의 안 됨 — 모든 후속 cycle 이 'mechanism vs corpus' ambiguity 위에 쌓임. (b) §99 (이론 문헌) 와 §100 (arc-internal audit) 두 *독립 방법* 이 같은 답으로 수렴 = cross-tool 합의, single-method artifact 아님. (c) §99 의 4-candidate compose (C1 diversity-threshold corpus / C2 interaction-loop / C3 LTC substrate / C6 spontaneous-as-prediction) 모두가 *이 control 의 cross 위에서만* meaningful — 본 gap 안 닫으면 4-candidate 도 conditional."
  honest_status = "§101 (commit 7809a06f0, B-S101 10/10 🔵) 이 fire-decidable 하게 만드는 closed-form 설계 land — Q1 CORPUS_S101 (S1 §16-verbatim + S2 Ψ-framings + S3* dual-anima loop + S4* action-perception + S5 anchor-expansion, 7 invariants), Q2 THRESHOLD_CROSSED = A1∧A2∧A3∧A4 (held-out routing · §9 honest-coherent · §17 physics · emit-length-indep), Q3 FIRE_DECISION = 7-AND 평가 Y at design-tier on §101's own design state. §101 자체로 GOAL emergence 결정 아님 — fire 가 informative 하게 만든 것 (Y 면 GOAL 첫 measured progress · N 이면 §1.1 부분 반증 잔여 = §95/§96 substrate axis). §102 (CORPUS_S101 actual build $0) + §103 (param-axis integration design $0) LANDED. **§107 (data-axis fire on §102 CORPUS_S101 @283M) DISPATCHED 2026-05-19 → ORPHAN-LOST** (self-managing nohup ~2h25m, ZERO post-dispatch artifacts, THRESHOLD_CROSSED §101 Q2 NOT evaluated — §46/§50/§79-class honest carry; PHILOSOPHY g6 §verdict_dataregime_threshold_fire_s107_orphan_lost_2026_05_19). **이 gap = STILL UNTESTED — §107 settled NOTHING (no measurement, NOT a refutation, NOT a confirmation).** §107-RETRY = 별도 fire-gate 결정 (2h25m silent-failed undiagnosable cost-bearing fire → options+recommendation 사용자 surfaced, NOT unilateral re-dispatch). **§107 SALVAGE 2026-05-19 (PHILOSOPHY g6 §verdict_dataregime_threshold_fire_s107_salvage_2026_05_19): ORPHAN-LOST → NEVER-TRAINED-IMPORT-BUG.** Live pod recovered (key re-verified working, SSH'd before terminating): §107 crashed in ~2s at `train_s107.py:28 ImportError train_main` (canonical §16 trainer exposes `run(cfg)` only); 0 training steps, out_main/ empty; pod idled 2.6h post-crash (~$3.90 idle-billed, NOT $0) then orchestrator-TERMINATED ($0 ongoing, cost-containment §50). 2-line code bug FIXED + py_compile-verified + cfg-key run()-compat verified. **§107-RETRY 2026-05-19 (PHILOSOPHY g6 §verdict_dataregime_threshold_fire_s107_retry_2026_05_19): FIRED CLEAN → THRESHOLD-NOT-CROSSED — WALL-A 첫 MEASURED.** §107-RETRY 재발사가 4개 dispatch-infra 버그를 더 노출 (attempt-1 SSH 창 / attempt-2 PUBLIC_KEY env 미주입 / attempt-3 corpus-build ROOT 경로 / attempt-4 cfg `log_every` 누락 — salvage 의 'cfg already matches run()' 주장이 틀렸음) — 전부 fix, attempt-5 가 cfg=§16 byte-equal + $0 로컬 sanity 검증 + dispatch fail-fast 후 clean 발사. §16-class d768·12L·283.72M from-scratch, §102 CORPUS_S101 (603MB/168-anchor/§104 I4'=TRUE) 6000-step, train CE 5.631→0.003 memorization-saturated. **§101 Q2 THRESHOLD_CROSSED = A1∧A2∧A3∧A4 — 측정값, 4축 전부 FAIL** (A1 routing held-out 0/16 · A2 §9 honest-coherent 0/16 · A3 PHYSICS_RESPONSIVE=True 이나 Ψ_dir spread 0.056<0.20 · A4 emit-length-indep r_emit_late 0). THRESHOLD_CROSSED=False, axis1 full-64 0/64, §62 echo-collapse present. B-S107 10/10 🔵 post-fire (central 0-diff). **이 gap = 이제 TESTED — §107-RETRY 가 WALL-A 를 처음으로 측정.** 결과: data-axis 단독 @283M 으로는 §101 Q2 emergence 술어 미통과 — §1.1 자체 반증 아님 (threshold 가 CORPUS_S101 diversity 위에 있거나, 병목이 param-scale §103/§108 또는 substrate §95/§96 일 수 있음). **next-step CORRECTED** (PHILOSOPHY g6 §verdict_..._retry_next_step_correction): §107-RETRY 측정 bit (A3-axis PASS=False) 을 §108 자체 Q5 dispatch tree 에 넣으면 Sub-case A → DISPATCH_§108=False, substrate (§95/§96) pivot — **§108 param-axis 3B fire 는 §108 tree 상 WARRANTED 아님** (직전 "§108 WARRANTED" 는 §103 generic-SEQUENTIAL carry 오류, 철회). §108 Q5 Sub-case A 가 "A3-axis-fail" 을 "physics-frozen" 과 conflate (§107-RETRY PHYSICS_RESPONSIVE=True, physics 살아있음) → 다음은 fire-gate 결정 (substrate pivot OR §108-Q5 reconciliation), auto-dispatch 아님. g3: THRESHOLD_CROSSED=False = valuable measured negative, NOT GOAL emergence, NOT §1.1 반증 (B-EMERGE-7 necessary-not-sufficient). north-star + §15/§51/§72 milestone UNCHANGED, GOAL 미도달."
  honest_dim_caveat = "본 gap 은 *data-axis* dimension. HEXAD/LLM.md (2026-05-19) 가 user 통찰로 *param-axis* dimension 추가 — Wei et al. 2022 LLM emergent abilities 가 param-count 임계점 (3B/8B/10B/62B) 에서 나타남. anima 283M = 모든 임계점 1/10~1/200. §11-A SCALE-DECOMP 가 1B 까지만 측정 (FLAT) — 3B+ 영역 미측정. 진짜 control = (param × data) 2D 평면 위 emergence-zone cross. §103 이 joint vs sequential 2-axis cross design 결정 중."
  apply = "(1) 모든 후속 §N entry 가 본 gap 을 carry — 'GOAL 미도달' 만 적지 말고 '이 gap 닫히기 전까지 모든 negative 는 data-vs-mechanism ambiguity' 명시. (2) 후속 fire 는 §101 Q3' (param-axis 통합 Q3', §103 결과) 통과 필수. (3) 본 gap 닫는 fire 결과가 어느 쪽이든 (Y/N) DIFFERENTLY informative — manufactured Y fire 보다 honest design-only landing 이 가치 높음 (§101 honest finding carry). (4) UI 표시: HEXAD/README.md 최상단 '🔑 PRIORITY #1 GAP' callout 으로 standing visibility."
